<Base
  title="The Art of Precision Prospecting: How Signal Detection Changes the Sales Game | Urban Gavelin"
  description="Most sales teams think their problem is too few leads. The real problem is too many low-probability opportunities clogging the pipeline. Signal-based prospecting fixes that."
  lang="en"
